gdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc153dx.jpg"}, {"id": 1917286, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc153dy.jpg"}, {"id": 1917287, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc153dz.jpg"}], "slug": "broken-drive", "storyline": "Trapped within the confines of an unsettling and ever-shifting apartment, a grieving father finds himself locked in an unending cycle of time and memory. Suffering from the disorienting effects of dementia and haunted by an unspeakable family tragedy, he must navigate familiar corridors that subtly warp and distort each day.\n\nAs the boundary between reality, guilt, and repressed trauma blurs, he is forced to confront the dark truth behind a fatal car crash\u2014a tragedy his fractured mind desperately attempts to classify as an accident, even as the walls whisper a far more sinister reality. To escape the psychological loop, he must piece together what truly happened before his remaining memories slip away into the dark.", "summary": "Step into the mind of a grieving father who lost his daughter in a tragic car crash. Trapped in a terrifying loop within an abandoned hospital created by his own dementia-riddled subconscious, you must face your deepest fears. Broken Drive is a first-person psychological horror game.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/broken-drive", "videos": [{"id": 195555, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "RcrrT82P-SI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RcrrT82P-SI", "title": "[Broken Drive] - Official Announcement Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RcrrT82P-SI/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}